Paper
==============================================================================

The renderer in this distribution implements:

  Wu, Q., Bauer, D., Doyle, M. J., and Ma, K.-L. (2024).
  Interactive Volume Visualization via Multi-Resolution Hash Encoding Based
  Neural Representation.
  IEEE Transactions on Visualization and Computer Graphics 30(8): 5404-5418.
  doi:10.1109/TVCG.2023.3306859

See `CITATION.bib` and `CITATION.cff` for citation metadata.

